{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_01_about_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your Switchblade in frantic combat against an endless swarm of enemies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switchblade is a frantic top-down shooter where you use your titular Switchblade to shoot and ram through waves of alien creatures. Pave your way through the endless swarm, and be careful not to overheat!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_02_features_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 game modes, including Fury, Surge, and Blaze!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 intense levels, featuring 3 boss battles and multiple ranks to aim for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of unlocks including, palettes, backgrounds, maps, game modes, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online  Leaderboards to compete against the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_03_dev_notes_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Switchblade I wanted to make a classic arcade-style game with quick runs and tons of replayability, with the classic pick-up and play, easy to learn hard to master gameplay loop, and a ton of extra unlockable content to keep things fresh. I wanted anyone to be able to pick it up and have a good time, without needing to be good at these kinds of games. I hope you enjoy it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238790?t=1744063499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744063499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/14e0a02ec925cf6d807defe8a3b17a097b40fb43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744063499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/14e0a02ec925cf6d807defe8a3b17a097b40fb43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744063499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3297930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_01_about_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your Switchblade in frantic combat against an endless swarm of enemies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switchblade is a frantic top-down shooter where you use your titular Switchblade to shoot and ram through waves of alien creatures. Pave your way through the endless swarm, and be careful not to overheat!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_02_features_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 game modes, including Fury, Surge, and Blaze!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 intense levels, featuring 3 boss battles and multiple ranks to aim for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of unlocks including, palettes, backgrounds, maps, game modes, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online  Leaderboards to compete against the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/extras/about_section_03_dev_notes_small.png?t=1744063499\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Switchblade I wanted to make a classic arcade-style game with quick runs and tons of replayability, with the classic pick-up and play, easy to learn hard to master gameplay loop, and a ton of extra unlockable content to keep things fresh. I wanted anyone to be able to pick it up and have a good time, without needing to be good at these kinds of games. I hope you enjoy it!</p>","developers":["Noba"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238790/header.jpg?t=1744063499","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118038,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118038/movie480.mp4?t=1743341484","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118038/movie_max.mp4?t=1743341484"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118038/ff06264e49f5fad2e98ba506b611f9039b12cc14/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743341484","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118038/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743341484","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118038/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743341484"}}],"name":"Switchblade","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br